# Daily discovery operations

Install the versioned units after deploying the API image:

```bash
scripts/install_daily_discovery_units.sh
```

Yapo runs daily with one page per target, a three-second minimum pause, a
30-minute timeout, its own lock and up to 45 minutes of jitter. Discovery is
additive and never marks a listing removed because it is absent from a search
page.

Portal uses one page, up to five details, a three-second minimum pause, a
20-minute timeout, its own lock and up to 45 minutes of jitter. Enable its
timer only after a clean dry-run followed by a clean real canary.
